  8192 x 40, auto multi-buffer off    : 218.8  (same as on)
  => halving the core count costs 5-7%, not 2x, so 40 cores already saturate;
     tile size and multi-buffering do not move it.  16384 only compiles with
     auto multi-buffer off (2 x 2 x 64 KiB = 256 KiB > 192 KiB UB).

